From a7c7605292a6a4c533d557013b55ef37f48759bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristian Rickert <kristian@apache.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:51:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Scope protoc configuration to each module

The source and include directories in pluginManagement applied to every
module that runs protoc. trino-hive-formats has no src/main/proto and
failed to build, and trino-kafka inherited the directories as well.
