 plugin/trino-hive/pom.xml          | 11 +++++++++++
 plugin/trino-memory/pom.xml        | 11 +++++++++++
 plugin/trino-tpch/pom.xml          | 11 +++++++++++
 pom.xml                            |  9 ---------
 6 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

