From d3eb0fe4a011422f96199e95c53df2f6edf193f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristian Rickert <kristian@apache.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:51:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Harden protobuf domain decoding

Reject a block of the wrong class for the domain type, an invalid type id
and bytes after the block with a TrinoException instead of letting a raw
ClassCastException or IllegalArgumentException escape.

Decode a normalized discrete set without rebuilding every value as a
Range, as the JSON deserializer does. Large dynamic filter domains decoded
slower than JSON before this change.
